Vendored PlantUML themes
------------------------

The following PlantUML theme files are vendored (verbatim) for fully offline
diagram theming under:

    packages/ui/src/components/chat/markdown/plantuml/themes/

Upstream project : plantuml/plantuml  (https://github.com/plantuml/plantuml)
Pinned commit    : 597262b70fb50671094413e3b6c3a0ef49de9a97
Upstream path    : src/main/resources/themes/puml-theme-<name>.puml

  * puml-theme-plain.puml
      Theme "plain" by Matthew Leather.
      License: PlantUML core theme (distributed as part of plantuml/plantuml).

  * puml-theme-mono.puml
      Theme "mono" by Denis Bondarenko feat. Matthew Leather.
      License: PlantUML core theme (distributed as part of plantuml/plantuml).

  * puml-theme-sunlust.puml
      Theme "sunlust" by Artem V. Ageev.
      License: GPL-3.0-or-later (GPL 3+).

  * puml-theme-toy.puml
      Theme "toy" by future-architect (https://github.com/future-architect).
      Source: https://github.com/future-architect/puml-themes
      License: Apache License, Version 2.0.

  * puml-theme-reddress-lightblue.puml
      Theme "reddress-lightblue" by Drakemor (https://github.com/Drakemor).
      Source: https://github.com/Drakemor/RedDress-PlantUML
      License: MIT.

Each file is used verbatim except that its leading YAML front-matter metadata
block (--- ... ---, containing name/license/author fields) is stripped at load
time because it is not valid PlantUML source.
